  "boardName": "(고교)생명과학수업 이야기",
  "title": "염색체 뽑기 학습활동 (부모 유전형질의 전달)",
  "author": "김영학(성호고)",
  "userid": "gH3G",
  "created": "18.08.23",
  "viewCnt": 2867,
  "commentCnt": 8,
  "headCont": "",
  "contentval": "0000rzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzz",
  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/dglf/53",
  "contentHtml": "<p>부모의 유전형질이 자식에게 전달되는 과정을 </p><p>학습하는 활동으로 </p><p>염색체 윷놀이 게임이 있습니다.</p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"http://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/IDO/713\">http://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/IDO/713</a></p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"http://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/IDO/32\">http://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/IDO/32</a></p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"http://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/IDO/713\"></a></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>해당활동을 </p><p>이번에 새롭게 만들어보았습니다.</p><p><br></p><p>1. 2명이 부부가 되어 </p><p>&nbsp; 아래처럼 각각&nbsp;8개의 염색체를 가위로 오려서&nbsp;2개의 종이컵에 담습니다.</p><p><img width=\"329\" height=\"425\" style=\"width: 432px; height: 220px;\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/994DB0405B7E203B08\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"475\" height=\"300\" style=\"width: 475px; height: 300px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"KakaoTalk_20180823_114619013.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"960\"  id=\"A_994DB0405B7E203B08B766\"/></p><p><br></p><p>2. 뽑는 방법과 의미를 질문하고 설명하게 합니다. 질문에 대해 정확한 답변을 하면 </p><p>&nbsp; 뽑기 게임활동을 시작합니다.</p><p>&nbsp; <!--StartFragment--></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">질문 예시</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l28 level1 lfo29;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">- 종이컵의 의미는 무엇입니까</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">?</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l28 level1 lfo29;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">- 모두 몇 개를 어떻게 뽑아야 하나요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">? (종이컵 내부를 들여다보고 뽑으면 안되는 이유는?)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l28 level1 lfo29;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">- 1</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">번 염색체를 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">개 뽑으면 안되나요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">?</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l28 level1 lfo29;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">- 한개의 염색체에 유전자를 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">AA</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">라고 안쓰고</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, <span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">A</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">라고 쓴 이유는</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">?</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><font face=\"Gulim\">- </font>자식을 만들려면 어떻게 해야 하나요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">?</span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>3. 랜덤으로 뽑은 후 아래의 양식에 붙입니다.</p><p><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99C9B7415B7E222807\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"676\" height=\"344\" style=\"width: 676px; height: 344px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"KakaoTalk_20180823_114619317.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"960\"  id=\"A_99C9B7415B7E222807F535\"/></p><p><br></p><p>(첨부)</p><p>1. 해당활동 활동지입니다.</p><p><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3Ddglf%26dataid%3D53%26fileid%3D3%26regdt%3D20180823121055&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile284.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F99CC05385B7E2303313D3B')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_etc_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> 염색체 뽑기 게임 학습지(김영학).hwp</a></p><p><br></p><p>2. 염색체 양식입니다.<br></p><p><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3Ddglf%26dataid%3D53%26fileid%3D4%26regdt%3D20180823121055&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile282.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F990C13355B7E23E717B474')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_etc_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> 염색체 뽑기 양식(성호고 김영학).hwp</a></p><p><br></p><p>3. 혹시 해당활동을 좀 더 탐구활동으로 구성하려면</p><p>&nbsp; 해당활동 전에 탐구계획을 스스로 세워보게 해도 좋습니다.</p><p>&nbsp; 해당 활동지 첨부합니다.<br></p><p><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3Ddglf%26dataid%3D53%26fileid%3D5%26regdt%3D20180823121055&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile258.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F99DCE5365B7E24DD1B5405')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_etc_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> 염색체 뽑기 게임 만들기 활동 1차시.hwp</a></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>---------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p>그리고 저희 학교는 실험조교 선생님이 계셔서 같이 팀티칭을 하였습니다.</p><p>아래는 팀티칭한 후 조교 선생님께서 작성하신 소감문입니다.</p><p><br></p><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림;\">1. 조교 </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림;\">선생님이 학생들에게 도움이 된 점</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림;\">&nbsp; 수업지도 교사의 역할을 분담하여 진행하였기에 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림;\">더 많은 학생들에게 설명을 해줄 수 있었습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림;\">또한 진행 인력이 두명이기에 수업 진행시 발생 되는 기타 소비시간을 단축하여 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림;\">학습시간을 좀 더 용이하게 쓰게 한다는 점이 학생들에게 이점으로 다가갈것 같습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 9pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 9pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림;\">학생들이 학습하는데 어려워했던 점</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림;\">&nbsp; 학습 진행전 어떤 방식의 수업인지 또한 어떠한 개념들인지 설명을 하였음에도 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림;\">수업의 진행방식을 이해하지 못한 학생들이&nbsp;종종 있었습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림;\">학생들의 집중을 끌어올리고 이해를 좀 더 원활히 할 수 있는 교수법이 있으면 좋을 것 같습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 9pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 9pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림;\">3. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림;\">수업 방식의 좋았던 점</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림;\">&nbsp; 강의식의 수업방식보다 활동적이기에 학생들이 적극적으로 참여할 수 있었고 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림;\">&nbsp;훨씬 효율적으로 지식을 습득할 수 있었다고 생각합니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림;\">활동적인 분위기 속에서 이루어졌기에 학생들이 자발적으로 질문하고 알고자 하는 모습을 볼 수 있었습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 9pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 9pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림;\">4. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림;\">수업 방식의 개선점  </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림;\">&nbsp; 학생들의 집중도를 조금 더 끌어올릴 수 있는 무언가의 간단한 활동이 있으면 좋겠습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림;\">!</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]--> -----------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">현장에 적용해보시고</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">피드백 부탁드립니다.</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">고맙습니다.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
